Made onair, with you as Ana.
Send this link to the people you want in it. It works for a day, while this computer is on:

  svrngs://join/<the token>

onair's folder is /private/tmp/onair-sign-w/ana/svrngs/onair: what anyone in onair puts there reaches this computer, and what you put there reaches theirs.

Leave this running; Ctrl-C stops it.
